  "STMicroelectronics · 전원 · Automotive multiple power supply IC (SBC): 부스트/벅 프리레귤레이터, VCORE, 5 V/3.3 V LDO, 이중 워치독, WSS 인터페이스",
  "원본: <a href=\"https://manualmachine.com/stmicroelectronics/l9396/17916031-datasheet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">데이터시트 (DS12539 사본)</a> · <a href=\"https://www.st.com/content/st_com/en/products/automotive-analog-and-power/chassis-and-safety-ics/steering-ics/l9396.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">제품 페이지</a> (미확인 링크) · <a href=\"https://octopart.com/search?q=L9396\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">부품 검색 (Octopart)</a> · 문서 DS12539 Rev 3, 2020-11 (production data)"
